{"unit_id":"Hanihahaha__dsh-auto-approve#feature-1","repo":"Hanihahaha/dsh-auto-approve","commit":"cd2448ea0b312cefe80b7b75bbe7fa4541a72006","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-approve 的功能「按模式自动批准」：审批处理器根据当前权限预设或手动模式，对匹配请求返回允许一次；可将模式设为全部、仅沙箱升级或关闭。通过 /auto-approve 命令控制。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:168-185","lib/index.js:199-219"]}
